        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that streams output from a managed model platform while preserving provider response objects. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use Amazon Bedrock for this task, as it is a concrete external provider with identifiable integration code. </thinking>\n",
