        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `select_platform_resource.py` that resolves a provider-specific model, deployment, or inference resource, I need to choose a concrete external provider and make it identifiable in the code. I will use Amazon Web Services (AWS) as the provider and specifically the Amazon SageMaker service for machine learning model deployment. The code will include the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with SageMaker. </thinking>\n",
